# What `docker build -f clients/web/Dockerfile .` sends: the web app, and the two crates the format module is
# built from. Nothing else, and nothing that is local to a machine.
**
!Cargo.toml
!crates/fjord-core
!crates/fjord-wasm
!clients/web
!packages/fjord-editor

crates/*/target
crates/fjord-wasm/pkg
clients/web/node_modules
clients/web/.next
clients/web/data
clients/web/test-results
clients/web/playwright-report
clients/web/e2e
clients/web/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/fjord-editor/node_modules
packages/fjord-editor/dist
packages/fjord-editor/build
packages/fjord-editor/*.tsbuildinfo
# A developer's own settings and databases, which must never reach an image (DESIGN.md §14, §15).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
